@startuml
skinparam participantPadding 10
actor Clinician
participant Client
participant Gateway
participant "Storage (IPFS/Arweave)" as Storage
participant "Chain: Anchor/Revocation" as Chain

Clinician -> Client: create FHIR resource
Client -> Client: encrypt (AES-GCM per-resource), produce aad
Client -> Storage: store ciphertext -> CID
Client -> Gateway: submit metadata (CID, resourceType, patientDID, hash)
Gateway -> Chain: anchor integrity hash/Merkle root
Gateway -> Gateway: issue capability to patient/role scopes (TTL, revHandle)
Gateway --> Clinician: ack (tx hash, cap handles)
Gateway -> Gateway: audit log append
Gateway -> Chain: optional audit root anchor (periodic)
@enduml
